findings.description:
Several comments and messages still state invariants this PR breaks. In `src/cli/index.ts`:
- the `callingSession` JSDoc says "the acceptor is the constant `human` now";
- the `callingConductor` JSDoc says the conductor "is refused the merge";
- the merge-action comment (~L1566) says "the whole command is operator-only, not only `--pr`";
- the `uiReadOnlyReason` comment and on-screen text (~L1163/L1175) say the merge is refused to the conductor.
